# The contacts of the library: two bodies that meet, in the words of the
# language. `_sumo` is the library's own (`who push other`, which picks who
# wins), never written in a film.

# A shove of sumo, who winning: they lock, strain and tremble, then the other is thrown back and falls.
define _sumo who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  other face who
  wait 0.2s
  who pose pull loop
  other pose pull loop
  who tremble
  other tremble
  sound jolt
  wait 1.2s
  who tremble off
  other tremble off
  who pose off
  other pose off
  sound strike
  other hurt back 24
  other fall back
  wait 0.4s
  who hop happy
end

# He pulls the other along: he takes hold and walks back, the other dragged after him, staggering.
define tug who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  other face who
  wait 0.2s
  who pose pull loop
  other tremble
  other emote sweat
  wait 0.8s
  other tremble off
  other follow who
  who walk to behind who slow backward
  other follow off
  other face who
  who pose off
  other pose stagger
  wait 0.4s
  other pose off
end

# He tickles the other, who laughs and wriggles.
define tickle who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  other face who
  who pose double loop
  other tremble
  other emote laugh
  sound laugh
  wait 1s
  who pose off
  other tremble off
  other jump height 4
  other jump height 4
end

# He bites the other: a snap of his head, the other hurt and shocked.
define chomp who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  other face who
  who pose headbutt
  wait 0.2s
  sound strike
  other hurt
  other emote shock
  other jump height 8
  wait 0.5s
end

# A high five: face to face, they jump up together, glad.
define high_five who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  other face who
  wait 0.2s
  who jump height 10 &
  other jump height 10
  sound click
  who emote joy silent
  other emote joy
  wait 0.4s
end

# He gives the other a leg up: crouched, the other climbs on his head and springs off there.
define boost who:pokemon other:pokemon to where:place
  other walk to who
  who face other
  who pose cringe
  other ride on who head
  wait 0.4s
  who tremble
  wait 0.4s
  who tremble off
  other get_off to where
  who pose off
end

# He gives the other a leg up: crouched, the other climbs on his head and springs off before him.
define boost who:pokemon other:pokemon
  other walk to who
  who face other
  who pose cringe
  other ride on who head
  wait 0.4s
  who tremble
  wait 0.4s
  who tremble off
  other get_off to front_of who
  who pose off
end

# He lifts the other up over his head, with an effort, and holds him there (put_down to set him down).
define lift who:pokemon other:pokemon
  who walk to other
  who face other
  who pose cringe
  who tremble
  who emote sweat silent
  wait 0.5s
  who tremble off
  who pose off
  who carry other
  who hop happy
end
